---@field Time? aws.timestream_write.StringValue256 Contains the time at which the measure value for the data point was collected. The time value plus the unit provides the time elapsed since the epoch. For example, if the time value is 12345 and the unit is ms, then 12345 ms have elapsed since the epoch.
